      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-q336630\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 6</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\">A tank initially holds <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"224\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>260</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>L</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of a dye solution containing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"225\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>kg</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of dye.\nPure water is poured into the tank at a rate of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"226\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>L/min</mtext><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> while the completely mixed solution leaves the tank at a rate of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"227\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>L/min</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nFind an equation for the amount of dye <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"228\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> in kilograms, in the tank <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"229\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes after the pure water is first added.<div class=\"freeResponseLine\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"230\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:60px;\n                                        margin-left:2px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"1\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"3\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"5\">8</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"7\">e</var><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"9\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"11\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"10\" class=\"\">−</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"12\">t</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"14\">/</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"16\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"18\">0</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"231\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the amount of dye in the tank at time <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"232\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> the derivative \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"233\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\ndescribes how this amount changes with respect to time <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"234\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> in minutes. This is equal to the rate at which dye enters the tank minus the rate at which dye leaves the tank.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"235\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.217em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.256em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>in</mtext></mrow><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>out</mtext></mrow><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Note that the units of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"236\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.26em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>in</mtext></mrow><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"237\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.206em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>out</mtext></mrow><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"238\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>kg</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mtext>min</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Now, let's compute the required rates of change in steps.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 1</strong>: Calculating the rate at which dye enters the tank.</p>\n<p>First, note that pure water (i.e., a solution containing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"239\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>kg/L</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of dye) enters the tank at a rate of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"240\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>L/min</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So, the rate at which the <em>dye</em> enters the tank is </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"241\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable styl